gxr-finish NOTICE

src/resample/ is a Rust port of Pillow 12.2.0's image resampler
(src/libImaging/Resample.c, src/libImaging/Convert.c RGBA<->RGBa,
src/libImaging/ImagingUtils.h, and src/PIL/Image.py resize()).

src/ink/ (image.rs, paste.rs, draw.rs, draw_ellipse.rs, draw_arc.rs, blur.rs)
includes Rust ports of Pillow 12.2.0's non-text drawing, compositing, and 3-pass box
blur (src/libImaging/Draw.c, BoxBlur.c, Paste.c, AlphaComposite.c, Convert.c,
Point.c, Crop.c, Geometry.c, Chops.c, src/PIL/Image.py, ImageDraw.py,
ImageFilter.py).

