src/ink/ (image.rs pairwise_sum_f32, rng.rs, rng_tables.rs) includes Rust
ports of NumPy 2.4.3's pairwise summation, SeedSequence, PCG64 bit generator,
and Ziggurat normal distribution tables and sampling
(numpy/_core/src/umath/loops_arithm_fp.dispatch.c.src,
numpy/random/bit_generator.pyx, numpy/random/src/distributions/distributions.c,
numpy/random/src/distributions/ziggurat_constants.h, and
numpy/random/src/pcg64/pcg64.h).

